   = help: the value comes from `s`; write `where carries(s), carries(s.a)` to say so
   = help: an owned copy observes nothing and needs no clause: declare the result `Result[String, mem.Oom]` and return `….to_owned()`, which copies the text and can fail with `mem.Oom`
